      {
        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "b78e2583-df33-54d2-be08-3d97da48afaf",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Denny Doherty, John Phillips\n- Groups: the Mamas & the Papas\n- Works: \"I Saw Her Again\"\n- Charts: RPM Canadian Singles Chart, UK Singles Chart, Billboard Hot 100\n\nFacts:\n- Dennis Gerrard Stephen Doherty was born on November 29, 1940, and he was a Canadian singer, songwriter, musician, and actor.\n- In 1966, the U.S. vocal group the Mamas & the Papas recorded the pop song \"I Saw Her Again.\"\n- In June 1966, \"I Saw Her Again\" was released as a single.\n- In June 1966, WLS played \"I Saw Her Again\" for most of the month.\n- \"I Saw Her Again\" was co-written by band members John Phillips and Denny Doherty.\n- In July 1966, \"I Saw Her Again\" peaked at number one on the RPM Canadian Singles Chart, number 11 on the UK Singles Chart, and number five on the Billboard Hot 100.\n- Dennis Gerrard Stephen Doherty died on January 19, 2007.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "629c8dae-d57f-5c20-98ec-64b1951a6686",
        "text": "Page: I Saw Her Again. Sentence: \"I Saw Her Again\" is a pop song recorded by the U.S. vocal group the Mamas & the Papas in 1966.\nPage: I Saw Her Again. Sentence: Co-written by band members John Phillips and Denny Doherty, it was released as a single in June 1966 (WLS played it most of that month) and peaked at number one on the \"RPM\" Canadian Singles Chart, number 11 on the UK Singles Chart, and number five on the \"Billboard\" Hot 100 pop singles chart in July 1966.\nPage: Denny Doherty. Sentence: Dennis Gerrard Stephen Doherty (November 29, 1940 – January 19, 2007) was a Canadian singer, songwriter, musician and actor.",
        "type": "DocumentChunk"
